{
  "schema": "deepsuck.core.extractors/v1",
  "comment": "情报提取规则。patterns 为正则源码 + flags（JS 语法，Python re 亦兼容：仅用定宽后行断言）。",
  "labels": {
    "bank_card": "银行卡号",
